  "description": "Trax 2.0 pairs an easy step-thru frame with true four-bar full suspension for confident comfort on streets, gravel, and trails. A 750W Bafang rear-hub motor with a torque sensor delivers smooth, proportional assist, while the 52V 20Ah battery supports up to 75 miles per charge. 26×4.0″ Kenda fat tires, Tektro HD-E3940 4-piston hydraulics, and a DNM AO-38RC rear air shock keep rides stable and controlled—topped off with a 1000-lumen headlight, integrated turn signals, and UL 2849 safety certification. Top speed up to 28 mph.\nQuick highlights\n\n750W Bafang hub motor + torque sensor for intuitive power.\n\n52V 20Ah battery • up to 75 miles range • up to 28 mph top speed.\n\nFour-bar full suspension: hydraulic dual-crown fork (lockout, 60 mm) + DNM AO-38RC 190×50 mm rear air shock.\n\nTektro HD-E3940 4-piston hydraulic disc brakes; 26×4.0″ puncture-resistant Kenda tires.\n\n3.7″ color LCD, integrated turn signals, ~1000-lumen headlight, 350 lb payload; rider height 5'7″–6'6″.\n\nUL 2849 certified electrical system.",
